WEBVTT

00:04:59.261 --> 00:05:01.268
meaning that you cut your phone off,

00:05:01.292 --> 00:05:02.879
put it on airplane mode,

00:05:02.903 --> 00:05:04.979
no email,

00:05:05.003 --> 00:05:07.259
and if you have a family,
if you have children,

00:05:07.283 --> 00:05:09.639
give yourself 20 minutes, five minutes.

00:05:09.663 --> 00:05:11.929
The goal is just
to give yourself time to write.

00:05:11.953 --> 00:05:13.326
What you're going to write

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.320
is you're going to focus on three things.

00:05:15.344 --> 00:05:17.231
You're going to focus on the details,

00:05:18.192 --> 00:05:21.202
you're going to focus
on the order of events,

00:05:21.226 --> 00:05:23.605
and you're going to focus
on how it made you feel.

00:05:23.629 --> 00:05:25.273
That is the most important part.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.056
I am the guinea pig today,

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:32.047
and so I'm going to walk you
through how I do it.